    <div class="card content">
      <h2 style="text-align:left;">吉林化工大学2026年招生章程</h2>
      <p class="time"> 2026-06-23 16:09:34 </p>
      <div id="contentContainer" >
        <div class="content zszc-content UEditor">
                        <h2 class="zszc-content-title">吉林化工大学2026年招生章程</h2>
                        <p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:黑体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:黑体">第一章</span> <span style="font-family:黑体">总则</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:黑体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">第一条</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="font-family:宋体">为规范学校</span><span style="font-family:宋体">202</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">6</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">年招生工作，依据《中华人民共和国教育法》《中华人民共和国高等教育法》等法律法规和教育部有关规定，特制定本章程。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:黑体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">第二条</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="font-family:宋体">本章程适用于</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">学校</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">202</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">6</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">年普通高等教育本科层次招生工作。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:黑体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">第三条</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="font-family:宋体">学校全称：吉林化工</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">大学</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">办学类型：公办普通本科学校</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">层</span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="font-family:宋体">次：本科</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:黑体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">第四条</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style="font-family:宋体">吉林化工</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">大学</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">龙潭校区：吉林省吉林市龙潭区铁东街道化院社区承德街</span><span style="font-family:宋体">45号；</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">吉林化工</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">大学</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">丰满校区：吉林省吉林市丰满区石井街道江炼社区石井沟街</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1666号</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">；</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">吉林化工</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">大学</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">双吉校区：吉林省吉林市吉林经济</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">技术</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">开发区双吉街道双飞社区</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">双吉街</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">民航路</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-indent:32px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:150%"><span s