><span style="font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">5500</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:30px"><td style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" width="411"><p style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">化学测量学与技术</span></p></td><td style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" width="102"><p style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">本科</span></p></td><td style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" width="287"><p style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">5000</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:30px"><td style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" width="411"><p style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">能源化学</span></p></td><td style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" width="102"><p style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">本科</span></p></td><td style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" width="287"><p style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">5000</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:30px"><td style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" width="411"><p style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">生物技术</span></p></td><td style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" width="102"><p style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">本科</span></p></td><td style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" width="287"><p style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">5000</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:30px"><td style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" width="411"><p style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">数学与应用数学</span></p></td><td style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" width="102"><p style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">本科</span></p></td><td style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" width="287"><p style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">5500</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:30px"><td style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: medium 1px 1px; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" width="411"><p style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">应用化学</span></p></td><td style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" width="102"><p style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">本科</span></p></td><td style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: medium 1px 1px medium; border-style: none solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" width="287"><p style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;font-size:16px">5500</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:30px"><td style="p